msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 079284788c11bd9a290dd39ca1faae1a5f0957e25d04a0ee732cf35469c60f6f
#. default-sha256: 50a881debaae3bf5b70a6e22291d2b662e12adbf00286a9627b6360045878a14
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it didn’t matter if it was all an illusion; ⟪k:1⟫the gentle breeze blowing in through "
"the window felt wonderful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non aveva importanza se era tutta un’illusione;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫la dolce brezza che soffiava "
"attraverso la finestra era magnifica."

#: scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d5808f03cd53051dd3b9ea2761ee056ed8ca23dd9d5ef0970e49a44b58d3225
#. default-sha256: a1255b9f296ef9f40d98c0c2f4a932cd0de33e7735ffda8a70acff96cc375a21
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The smell of grass, the chirping of birds, the glistening blue sky...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was like a "
"thousand memories rushing back all at once,⟪k:3⟫and it brought tears to my eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’odore dell’erba, il cinguettio degli uccelli, il cielo azzurro lucente...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫erano "
"come migliaia di ricordi che riaffioravano tutti in una volta,⟪k:3⟫e ciò mi portò le lacrime agli "
"occhi."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbf0bba82f3523ccc6ea2115b499a9c113e258de3b003c369940d0c7eeaf64cd
#. default-sha256: a6dd568e5e31f5b9209a80327622237f5b430993f6e56f187be7a56a3877b9a5
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as she always did, the witch’s voice crushed my elation,⟪k:1⟫dragging me back to reality."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E come suo solito, la voce della strega frantumò la mia gioia,⟪k:1⟫trascinandomi di nuovo "
"alla realtà."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee5de63588b96be4e9617a5a18b559063b52a53d817c3303e0cadcbd1d0ede7d
#. default-sha256: 4fc32e4ad9de31b40151e28153ad889fed773f2f4dbb92de7148d69897c14f2d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for it was that moment that began my true decline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫perché fu in quel momento che iniziò il mio vero declino."

#: scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 816f2d632b8ff66febf82ceae0cfa94a87ddaef8ed245f97d446be9ca7b6fc19
#. default-sha256: 05dca2f58b98efe175030fd04468633ea040ebd4b4caa71ca7298bcc7e5c2214
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Have you already forgotten?⟪k:1⟫Oh, good heavens... ⟪k:2⟫Do you have your head on straight, "
"my dear?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Te ne sei già dimenticata?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, santo cielo... ⟪k:3⟫Ci stai con la testa oppure no, "
"mia cara?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec5cfed717f19e99703d8bb5a48c129453d87bbbabc9f7be1ed040cb2e6ea52b
#. default-sha256: c82a9d8b50f9a0f3352973a80e4317690ff6a9500bf6a0986cb0fb97f2d31895
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...It looks like someone’s here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Sembra che qualcuno sia arrivato."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5ECC5EC6_1C2A_4C00_8926_9D15828AFB8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
