msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫(The bar has been removed...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫(La sbarra è stata rimossa...)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4118b05342561e60457c2d7889059b14fc24656429c9fda47f029eae91a330d4
#. default-sha256: 27ecdb534ed296192295273c5f0096228228e769eee20094c886b957168f0b2e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫............"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 863ce8c1c5b7feaa532ebbcaf46ffe98a60911425b8010227ab7238a4a50dd86
#. default-sha256: ccba0b47d6a86d4331cf2abfa6ad556d59438d04c733ecea30ffe9589435ad9b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt like I had stepped into Heaven on Earth.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know it sounds melodramatic, so "
"please don’t laugh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi sentivo come se avessi messo piede in un Paradiso sulla Terra.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫So che può "
"sembrare melodrammatico, quindi ti prego di non ridere."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cc9c582a6e5b88f1225e05568737507a6133e3e4a196eff164319fcba877b48
#. default-sha256: a7b075c515a3dbc0e31a1b5b2401ed4f051d773f3f34a58b1131a5ddbafeac08
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wondered where I was, of course, but I neither shouted nor jumped in surprise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mi domandai dove fossi, ovviamente, ma non gridai, né sobbalzai per la sorpresa."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bcf98d50eead3be6fa6dee63d776b7ac38be86b25824ff612817babda433742
#. default-sha256: 5b6eb8967d35afd5e15a546fe59320c70b7de2c564a1a831a9928eaf57b3efb1
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instead, I found myself accepting of my circumstances, as unnatural as they might have been."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Piuttosto, mi ritrovai ad accettare le circostanze, per quanto innaturali potessero essere."

#: scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a72302a41061c75e836a314c73e42a7a983d7c068f5165f41ddc42bd0fa704e8
#. default-sha256: 601c6cce3a8c29e799e3377c5b5ce5bcc2255a5fe4cb126bf19d9d779c6bd21f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫gad⟪k:7⟫... ⟪k:8⟫could this road be any bloody worse?⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫It’s in dire need of paving, on top of everything else..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Per⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫bacco⟪k:7⟫... ⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Può esserci una strada peggiore di "
"questa?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ha un urgente bisogno di pavimentazione, prima di ogni altra cosa..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cebe32c3a3976d67016718956a8555bee9138932b1a9104a46cc60d0e91e7f45
#. default-sha256: 948a97315e5ad6d3d64f5f3a757fd10907ff48d6e891d5cb2d4c119a3f474540
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He’s speaking a different language...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Parla una lingua diversa...)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 192256fdf3dc93ec577b096188d797317a9470ce1e06166beb49fad84874256e
#. default-sha256: eec59d338b870a5ccee5199aacb8a22dd5c8a9270220677026f2bfa8a06e4329
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The middle-aged man approached me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his attire and the way he held himself,⟪k:3⟫"
"he appeared to be upper-class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’uomo di mezza età si avvicinò.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dai suoi abiti e dal suo portamento sembrava "
"essere un aristocratico."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7e5d16fdab36d255ead42d16f1fb5c8119bc2172ca7d8a68b9ea3e22ef4f7d1
#. default-sha256: 38a0d24633d19893657bf6f57451082d5ce77b571b94e471d3156073d7d72d23
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the words coming out of his mouth were not in the language I had grown up speaking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In ogni caso, le parole che gli uscirono di bocca non erano nella lingua con cui ero "
"cresciuta."

#: scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6cc921996cc1698971bfa6a102adf69ea228abb647b3d2926fd3a31003b24b7
#. default-sha256: 915bf615050700e5cd2ee2cc33538c2ccb29bf7a7f7334bdefef1560705c1281
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I stood there staring at him absentmindedly, the more incredulous he became."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E più lo fissavo assorta, più lui diventava perplesso."

#: scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2cf5a427ff609cb5ff2c7e72d6836973d566a46ef353e8e2b06f1b0a7948fb6
#. default-sha256: 6c93f4599cce8719fb220b08e37e295f56b7c898b031cbc20704c0d9bc4b17d6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fortunately, I suppose, I was able to understand bits and pieces of what he had said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Fortunatamente, ero in grado di capire alcuni frammenti di ciò che aveva detto."

#: scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12737b9556061cf41ff9f15abe3b51a860f96ab4c6dc6e40d97578b90292fe41
#. default-sha256: 8be98a7f1ba764566d05462bec8e874389b8657f7e3e4ea815bbb49610ea9dbf
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As merchants in the capital, my family did business with people from other countries, and as "
"a result, I had learned a handful of words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In quanto mercanti della capitale, la mia famiglia faceva affari con persone di Paesi "
"diversi, e di conseguenza, avevo imparato qualche parola."

#: scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58343a0d950a76f0cfb73a269fceb553f662855f1a2084d67232d4991e79ca21
#. default-sha256: 127582629d767972b93a555185247dea3161ba1e643ace5d6827521433a77347
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The problem was... ⟪k:1⟫it had been so long ago, I had no confidence whatsoever in my "
"ability to hold a conversation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il problema... ⟪k:1⟫era che si trattava di molto tempo prima, e non avevo alcuna fiducia "
"nella mia capacità di reggere una conversazione."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 226242a16d4b5b7617f75ac482c6f9e50b7db8080969a27e009cd65fd8903cb0
#. default-sha256: d4d5147712238b192c89547fa0a11712f2321573aa198f3c1314c568ee4572b9
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am... ⟪k:3⟫I am a servant..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Io— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Io sono... ⟪k:3⟫sono una serva..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ce0b0b40e675888e3cc53af5e577467877d76b42ae70137adf12ce768e81083
#. default-sha256: 67e03fabd2e2a3c61b0a6266f1a079d2644ab8543f6eb22b13f2603b179c5d11
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You weren’t informed?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bloody hell. Off to a great start, I see.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Well, "
"what can you do, I guess..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Non sei stata informata?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per la miseria. Cominciamo bene, vedo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Beh, "
"che possiamo farci..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e7ba32ff324c9edb06a7dcdf4d2882a5912802ad4ab25e7fc3b60fca7941c6f
#. default-sha256: bde93b7c9d2317b9cbc89599590b5483bdd6deab550d9498661480f95462f69b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was also the first person I served under as the Maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Inoltre, era la prima persona che ho servito come “Domestica”."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7B5A3137_2B46_4EC5_8D88_DAFFE5D554E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c799288e1cb3d99b54f822a52b8751df1c9041c05acd47925662bb3bea15738
#. default-sha256: 68e82692b080c5dae68cd7a8e031bcdf470a9c9e4c958455abede893fd0fc19a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7B5A3137_2B46_4EC5_8D88_DAFFE5D554E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫For a member of an esteemed noble family, Hayden was "
"a bit on the eccentric side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Per essere il membro di una stimata famiglia nobile, "
"Hayden era piuttosto eccentrico."

