msgid "⟪k:0⟫He only hired a handful of servants,⟪k:1⟫claiming he was “not fond of clamor.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva assunto solo una manciata di servitori,⟪k:1⟫affermando di “non amare il baccano”."

