msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Listen carefully. A servant is the face of a house.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫A "
"servant’s gaffe is her master’s gaffe.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Always keep this in mind: you’re not “just” a "
"maid."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ascoltami attentamente. Una serva è il volto della casa.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫La gaffe di una serva è la gaffe del suo padrone.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Tieni sempre a mente questo: "
"⟪k:11⟫non sei “solo” una domestica."

#: scenario6:scenario6_BE1B00DC_14F2_4CFE_AA5A_7A5A953C0298
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19cbbf173a4cbf9d1f21da8e8b2af1c0fff87a9a3b45d6f46c32ac0df8a50e68
