msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your language must be immaculate.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No “um”s, “uh”s, or pauses.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For any "
"reason."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Inoltre, il tuo parlato dev’essere immacolato.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Senza “mmh”, senza “ehm” e senza "
"pause.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Per nessun motivo."

