msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ma non era affatto un’esperienza spiacevole,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_741F9928_4D1E_43A0_BD99_810CCA123F6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11fc749acaed8e83f138764bb99d4ee79effa582e8e54c4df1e645d13426f7b9
