msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His instruction may have been harsh, but it was human interaction. There were people around "
"that I could talk to, and that was wonderful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suoi insegnamenti potevano essere duri, ma era un contatto umano. C’erano persone intorno "
"a me con cui potevo parlare, e questo era magnifico."

