msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I don’t know what kind of life you’ve lived,⟪k:4⟫but I can’t imagine it’s "
"been all that easy.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Not many servant girls your age without a home to go back to."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non so che genere di vita tu abbia vissuto, ma non credo sia stata tanto "
"facile.⟪k:4⟫ Non sono molte le domestiche della tua età a non avere una casa in cui tornare."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F661F155_EA2B_427A_9EEE_53214517940B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f556e480ee811826d04e61df7115dae25e433db9aa92774e91aa351ad1daff4a
#. default-sha256: 2e9a250061c520c5d5ef4f31b720a4c7c6cd7ed88c40017fa06282dcc695fb93
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F661F155_EA2B_427A_9EEE_53214517940B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m sure you think I’m just a loud, obnoxious old man,⟪k:1⟫but I believe we met for a "
"reason, so I hope you’ll stick with me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono certo che mi consideri solo un chiassoso ed insopportabile vecchio, ma credo che ci "
"siamo incontrati per un motivo...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫pertanto, spero che rimarrai con me."

#: scenario6:scenario6_3088F00D_145C_43CE_95C2_2954B7E738B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36d62dbc6e061b3109583b21709ad0893fb1a2d63ce7a18f8eb3fcea81019bf9
