msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AA6DD54B_D864_41CD_A245_474E7EFA4644"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that time, the mansion underwent a number of decor changes, as Hayden brought in "
"sculptors to work on different areas of the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In quel periodo, la villa subì alcune modifiche d’arredamento, poiché Hayden aveva accolto "
"degli scultori per lavorare a diverse aree della casa."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B500_D7EC3B50E9A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfb13be0801a49ac6e4a9389a7d011909f6ae0c5f31922e446b5efbdfdb98599
#. default-sha256: 28a1cc2cf2f4b51593190159e6b950dbdbfb38030008baea13f1cf39a1514741
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B500_D7EC3B50E9A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He also sealed off rooms that were not in use—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫such as the observation tower and "
"the chapel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Inoltre sigillò le stanze inutilizzate—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫tra cui la torre d’osservazione e la "
"cappella."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B510_D7EC3B50E9A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42f509e266f19af8db71ef3e77f8e2ad1ea9e427f9c984d58568c150a49fd7df
#. default-sha256: 70e988f5aaa928ae6ed17efd5c899cd85bdee28289878829277705b190483832
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B510_D7EC3B50E9A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a sad thing, seeing areas with so many memories for me falling into disuse,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era triste vedere luoghi di cui conservavo così tanti ricordi cadere in disuso,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B530_D7EC3B50E9A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 334c7bccafa6216d2e633789585029ee672b4286cf098fb18c9c111a6d9cc13e
#. default-sha256: 79440891dc16cd4bafff0d24e2a2c294c4b902d49a8bc7a7e465798ed895037c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B530_D7EC3B50E9A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In addition, Hayden seemed to greatly enjoy renovating the house,⟪k:1⟫so I watched him "
"warmly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oltretutto, sembrava che a Hayden piacesse molto ristrutturare la villa, perciò lo osservavo "
"con entusiasmo."

#: scenario6:scenario6_6D322AFB_73C2_48C5_AF63_C186EA7F051C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c87cf50177f744f7693915ba529d35325a9ede4abdbc69fb83737354f3fccfb
#. default-sha256: fd2f46e998d0bab4e59f9e2e5e5af98f96da36d228bc63632f4d5ea15dbd037e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_6D322AFB_73C2_48C5_AF63_C186EA7F051C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫These roses come from all across the world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nowhere else can you see so many "
"different varieties in one place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Queste rose provengono da ogni parte del mondo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non troverai un giardino con così "
"tante varietà da nessun’altra parte."

#: scenario6:scenario6_6D0D4D91_D983_4C2A_8066_C984151CF214
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2c37b363662bc77772a43c55801a8ad869620e5481b3fa64be654e843fa43cf
#. default-sha256: 9817f789b789d0ac48bfa0ade6a541f7435f9b960375780a05a21a1c71532106
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_6D0D4D91_D983_4C2A_8066_C984151CF214"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫and to think there used to be nothing but weeds here.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Amazing how "
"much it has changed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫e pensare che qui non c’erano altro che erbacce.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ "
