msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hah. I have no interest in that wrinkled bag of bones.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And if he ⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ one "
"of them, do you really think I would have let him go so peacefully?"
