"⟪k:0⟫Setting two loved ones against one another,⟪k:1⟫manipulating one into taking the other’s "
"life,⟪k:2⟫and then forcing him to live with that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mettere due amati l’uno contro l’altra,⟪k:1⟫manipolando uno per togliere la vita all’altro,"
"⟪k:2⟫e costringendolo a conviverci per il resto dei suoi giorni."

